      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْلِثٌ</span></b>  A she-camel, and any female, <i>bringing
forth her third young one,</i> or <i>offspring:</i> one
should not say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ ثِلْثٌ</span>. (M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثَلِّثٌ</span>.

